================================================================================
SYNTHETIC SIMULATION & ETHICAL RESEARCH INTEGRITY NOTICE
================================================================================

All quantitative datasets, Monte Carlo panels, regression coefficients, 
participant interview transcripts, focus group dialogues, and thematic matrices 
generated by the Synthetic Data Forge or integrated AI tools are purely artificial 
mathematical simulations. They are engineered strictly for methodological pipeline 
validation, statistical power analysis, code unit testing, and pedagogical instruction. 
Under no circumstances should any synthetic data generated by this suite be 
represented, submitted, or published as genuine empirical observations or human 
subject research. Users are exclusively responsible for adherence to Committee on 
Publication Ethics (COPE) guidelines and Institutional Review Board (IRB) mandates.
